{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:44f05d34905904b1","name":"Crossbow","source":{"id":"source:reference-44f05d34905904b1","title":"Crossbow","revision":21297,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:31:46Z","sha256":"26672a3ef5c67b4289caa68c6ed5a07e06139a3009f5d96d0a962e048d348c1f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21297","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Crossbow&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-44f05d34905904b1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A primitive weapon used by cultures lacking access to blaster or black-powder weaponry, the Crossbow requires more time to reload than a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bow"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bow","referenceId":"reference:a01546128a8307bd"},", and it exchanges ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," for greater stopping power. In spite of these drawbacks, professional assassins use modified Crossbows because they are quiet and do not show up on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Detectors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Detectors?action=edit&redlink=1"},". As a further benefit to explorers, crossbow bolts can be manufactured by hand with a little time and effort, although the quality of such makeshift ammunition might be questionable.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Crossbow holds only a single bolt at a time, and it requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," to reload. A case of 10 crossbow bolts costs 20 credits and weighs 0.6 kg. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:845